---
description: Colab host bootstrap rules
globs: "host/colab/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Notebook selects exactly one model before startup.
- Pull and load only the selected Ollama model.
- Generate LiteLLM config for that single model.
- Print READY only after end-to-end public health checks pass.
- Never commit trycloudflare URLs or GATEWAY_API_KEY values.
